---
title: Taxonomy–Reification Identification (Phase 3)
---
flowchart LR
    classDef start fill:#1F4E79,color:#fff,stroke:#1F4E79
    classDef question fill:#BDD7EE,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef outcome fill:#D6E4F0,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E75B6
    classDef shacl fill:#EEF4F9,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#404040
    classDef skos fill:#E8F4E8,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#2E7F2E
    classDef reif fill:#FFF4EC,color:#1A1A1A,stroke:#E05A00

    START["Review all\nexemplar properties\nthat classify or\ncategorise"]:::start

    Q1{"Does this\ncategory have\nattributes of\nits own?"}:::question
    Q2{"Does the\nrelationship between\nsubject and category\nhave attributes?"}:::question
    Q3{"If reified: what\nproperties would\nthe relationship\ncarry?"}:::question

    SKOS["→ SKOS Taxonomy\n\nskos:Concept in a\nskos:ConceptScheme\n\nSHACL: sh:class skos:Concept\n+ sh:node scheme-validator"]:::skos

    REIF["→ Reification\nCandidate\n\nSketch reified Turtle form.\nReturn to Phase 2\nexemplars."]:::reif

    RSIMPLE["→ Simple sh:in\nor sh:or\n\nNo dedicated\nvocabulary needed"]:::shacl

    RSHAPE["→ sh:reifierShape\n(SHACL 1.2)\n\nex:RelationshipAnnotationShape\nwith required annotation\nproperties"]:::reif

    EMPTY["→ Reification\npremature\n\nKeep as simple\nproperty for now"]:::shacl

    NEW_TAX["→ New taxonomy\nfound\n\nReturn to taxonomy\nbranch for\nthis type"]:::skos

    START --> Q1

    Q1 -->|Yes| Q2
    Q1 -->|"No — small\nfixed set"| RSIMPLE
    Q1 -->|"No — open\nvocabulary"| SKOS

    Q2 -->|Yes| Q3
    Q2 -->|No| SKOS

    Q3 -->|"List is\nnon-empty"| RSHAPE
    Q3 -->|"List is\nempty"| EMPTY

    RSHAPE -->|"Annotation properties\nhave their own\nclassification needs"| NEW_TAX
    REIF --> Q3
